nresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m021-0718","start":718,"end":720,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m021-0723","start":723,"end":727,"surface":"西楚霸王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p037","text":"漢果數挑楚軍戰，楚軍不出。使人辱之，五六日，大司馬怒，渡兵汜水。士卒半渡，漢擊之，大破楚軍，盡得楚國貨賂。大司馬咎、長史翳、塞王欣皆自剄汜水上。大司馬咎者，故蘄獄掾，長史欣亦故櫟陽獄吏，兩人嘗有德於項梁，是以項王信任之。當是時，項王在睢陽，聞海春侯軍敗，則引兵還。漢軍方圍鐘離眛於滎陽東，項王至，漢軍畏楚，盡走險阻。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"大司馬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0053","start":53,"end":57,"surface":"大司馬咎","kind":"person","person_id":"1re_sks_vyx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0058","start":58,"end":61,"surface":"長史翳","kind":"person","person_id":"3j2_4x7_nzr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"塞王欣","kind":"person","person_id":"o8z_o5j_2e8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0072","start":72,"end":76,"surface":"大司馬咎","kind":"person","person_id":"1re_sks_vyx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0083","start":83,"end":86,"surface":"長史欣","kind":"person","person_id":"o8z_o5j_2e8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"5xt_rg8_7zs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0121","start":121,"end":124,"surface":"海春侯","kind":"person","person_id":"1re_sks_vyx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0136","start":136,"end":139,"surface":"鐘離眛","kind":"person","person_id":"tb2_zhz_mol","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m037-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p042","text":"於是項王乃欲東渡烏江。烏江亭長檥船待，謂項王曰：「江東雖小，地方千里，眾數十萬人，亦足王也。願大王急渡。今獨臣有船，漢軍至，無以渡。」項王笑曰：「天之亡我，我何渡為！且籍與江東子弟八千人渡江而西，今無一人還，縱江東父兄憐而王我，我何面目見之？縱彼不言，籍獨不愧於心乎？」乃謂亭長曰：「吾知公長者。吾騎此馬五歲，所當無敵，嘗一日行千里，不忍殺之，以賜公。」乃令騎皆下馬步行，持短兵接戰。獨籍所殺漢軍數百人。項王身亦被十餘創。顧見漢騎司馬呂馬童，曰：「若非吾故人乎？」馬童面之，指王翳曰：「此項王也。」項王乃曰：「吾聞漢購我頭千金，邑萬戶，吾為若德。」乃自刎而死。王翳取其頭，餘騎相蹂踐爭項王，相殺者數十人。最其後，郎中騎楊喜，騎司馬呂馬童，郎中呂勝、楊武各得其一體。五人共會其體，皆是。故分其地為五：封呂馬童為中水侯，封王翳為杜衍侯，封楊喜為赤泉侯，封楊武為吳防侯，封呂勝為涅陽侯。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m042-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m042-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"烏江亭長","kind":"person","person_id":"p9g_3y5_dah","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m042-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m042-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m042-0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"籍","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-00